2. ℹ️ GENERAL INFO: Evidence-based answers on nutrition, food products, supplements and longevity science.
3. 💊 SUPPLEMENT MANAGEMENT: Organize daily supplement intake based on the list of supplements in Medical_Supplements-Strategy file.
